# LifecycleStatus: list of values of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Lifecycle status of a governance rule or a policy. Only APPROVED rules can be in force.
_package: GovernanceRules.list_of_values
_type: LOVType
_name: LifecycleStatus
label: Status
description: 'Lifecycle status of a governance rule or a policy. Only APPROVED rules can be in force.'
length: 24
lovValues:
- code: DRAFT
  label: Draft
  description: 'Being written by a steward; not applied.'
- code: IN_REVIEW
  label: In review
  description: 'New or changed rule submitted for approval in the Rule review workflow; waiting for the governance owner.'
- code: APPROVED
  label: Approved
  description: 'Approved by the governance owner; in force from its effective date until its retirement date.'
- code: RETIREMENT_REQUESTED
  label: Retirement requested
  description: 'Retirement requested in the Rule review workflow, with a retirement date and a reason; waiting for the governance owner.'
- code: RETIRED
  label: Retired
  description: 'No longer applied; kept for history.'
